\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\ulnone\fs24 1. Introduction\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qj\b0 Artificial Intelligence (AI) has rapidly evolved from systems that simply analyse data and generate outputs to intelligent systems capable of independently making decisions and performing tasks. This new paradigm is known as \b Agentic AI\b0 .\par
Agentic AI refers to AI systems that can understand goals, make decisions, plan actions, interact with their environment, and continuously improve through learning. Unlike traditional AI models that mainly respond to user inputs, Agentic AI can proactively work toward objectives with minimal human intervention.\par

